tely supplied design retains its own grounds. The eventual receiver receives evidence relevance without surrendered decision authority.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XfeHmRBwX5gSamdRxhbLW4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
